.SH "نام (NAME)"
pkgctl-auth-status \- View authentication status
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
pkgctl auth status [OPTIONS]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Verifies and displays information about your authentication state of
services like the GitLab instance and reports issues if any.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-t, \-\-show\-token\fP
.RS 4
Display the auth token
.RE
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.RS 4
Show a help text
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
pkgctl\-auth\-login(1)
.SH "HOMEPAGE"
.sp
\fI\c
.URL "https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/devtools" "" "\fP"
.sp
Please report bugs and feature requests in the issue tracker. Please do your best to provide a reproducible test case for bugs.